  }\r\n                ]\r\n              }\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"updateAuthor\": {\r\n            \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Ab5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"accountId\": \"712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"emailAddress\": \"jack.watergun@gmail.com\",\r\n            \"avatarUrls\": {\r\n              \"48x48\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/48\",\r\n              \"24x24\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/24\",\r\n              \"16x16\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/16\",\r\n              \"32x32\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/32\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"displayName\": \"Jack Smith\",\r\n            \"active\": true,\r\n            \"timeZone\": \"America/New_York\",\r\n            \"accountType\": \"atlassian\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"created\": \"2026-03-22T07:52:37.784-0400\",\r\n          \"updated\": \"2026-03-22T07:52:37.784-0400\",\r\n          \"jsdPublic\": true\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10117/comment/10127\",\r\n          \"id\": \"10127\",\r\n          \"author\": {\r\n            \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Ab5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"accountId\": \"712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"emailAddress\": \"jack.watergun@gmail.com\",\r\n            \"avatarUrls\": {\r\n              \"48x48\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/48\",\r\n              \"24x24\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/24\",\r\n              \"16x16\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/16\",\r\n              \"32x32\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/32\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"displayName\": \"Jack Smith\",\r\n            \"active\": true,\r\n            \"timeZone\": \"America/New_York\",\r\n            \"accountType\": \"atlassian\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"body\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\r\n            \"version\": 1,\r\n            \"content\": [\r\n              {\r\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\r\n                \"content\": [\r\n                  {\r\n                    \"type\": \"text\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"## Analysis Progress (Cortana)\\n\\n### Current State Assessment\\n\\n**Data Gap Identified**: The current zone-based trading system (Boba, Sterling FX) tracks zone freshness as a **binary flag** (fresh: true/false) but does NOT track:\\n- Zone creation timestamp relative to entry\\n- Candles elapsed since zone formation\\n- Zone age at entry time\\n\\n**Evidence**:\\n- \\\\ (line 147-150): Zones store \\\\ timestamp but it's not used for filtering\\n- \\\\ (line 100-110): Zones store \\\\ but no age calculation\\n- Backtest data tracks \\\\ (2-68 range observed) but not \\n### Hypothesis Formation\\n\\nBased on supply/demand trading theory:\\n- **Fresh zones** (0-10 candles after formation) should have higher success rates\\n- **Stale zones** (50+ candles) may have diminished effectiveness\\n- There likely exists a **decay curve** showing success rate vs zone age\\n\\n### Required Infrastructure (INFRA ticket needed)\\n\\nTo test this hypothesis, we need:\\n1. Add \\\\ field to zone entry events\\n2. Track \\\\ = current_bar_index - zone_creation_bar_index\\n3. Log this in trade records for statistical analysis\\n\\n### Next Steps\\n\\n1. Create INFRA ticket for Hunter to add zone age tracking\\n2. Run 30 days of paper trading with zone age logging\\n3. Return to statistical analysis once n >= 40 trades per bucket\\n\\n**Status**: BLOCKED - Insufficient data. Need infrastructure enhancement first.\\n\\n---\\nAgent: Cortana | Timestamp: 2026-03-22 | Mode: Autonomous\"\r\n                  }\r\n                ]\r\n              }\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"updateAuthor\": {\r\n            \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Ab5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"accountId\": \"712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"emailAddress\": \"jack.watergun@gmail.com\",\r\n            \"avatarUrls\": {\r\n              \"48x48\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/48\",\r\n              \"24x24\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/24\",\r\n              \"16x16\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/16\",\r\n              \"32x32\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/32\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"displayName\": \"Jack Smith\",\r\n            \"active\": true,\r\n            \"timeZone\": \"America/New_York\",\r\n            \"accountType\": \"atlassian\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"created\": \"2026-03-22T07:54:36.629-0400\",\r\n          \"updated\": \"2026-03-22T07:54:36.629-0400\",\r\n          \"jsdPublic\": true\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10117/comment/10130\",\r\n          \"id\": \"10130\",\r\n          \"author\": {\r\n            \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Ab5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"accountId\": \"712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"emailAddress\": \"jack.watergun@gmail.com\",\r\n            \"avatarUrls\": {\r\n              \"48x48\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/48\",\r\n              \"24x24\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/24\",\r\n              \"16x16\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/16\",\r\n              \"32x32\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/32\"\r\n            },\r\n            \"displayName\": \"Jack Smith\",\r\n            \"active\": true,\r\n            \"timeZone\": \"America/New_York\",\r\n            \"accountType\": \"atlassian\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"body\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"doc\",\r\n            \"version\": 1,\r\n            \"content\": [\r\n              {\r\n                \"type\": \"paragraph\",\r\n                \"content\": [\r\n                  {\r\n                    \"type\": \"text\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"## Final Status: BLOCKED - Infrastructure Required\\n\\n### Findings Summary\\n- Zone freshness is currently BINARY (fresh: true/false)\\n- No tracking of zone age (candles since formation)\\n- Cannot calculate freshness decay rate without this data\\n\\n### Actions Taken\\n1. Created INFRA-23: Add zone_age_candles tracking to zone-based agents\\n2. This ticket depends on INFRA-23 completion + 30 days data collection\\n\\n### Hypothesis (Pending Validation)\\nBased on S&D theory, expected decay pattern:\\n- 0-10 candles: Peak effectiveness (60-70% win rate expected)\\n- 10-30 candles: Good effectiveness (50-60% win rate)\\n- 30-50 candles: Diminishing returns (40-50% win rate)\\n- 50+ candles: Stale zone (30-40% win rate)\\n\\n### Statistical Requirements\\n- n >= 40 trades per bucket for significance\\n- Testing period: 30-60 days after INFRA-23 deployed\\n- Analysis: Chi-square test for win rate differences between buckets\\n\\n### Status: BLOCKED\\nResume after INFRA-23 deployed + 30 days paper trading\\n\\n---\\nAgent: Cortana | Completed: 2026-03-22\"\r\n                  }\r\n                ]\r\n              }\r\n            ]\r\n          },\r\n          \"updateAuthor\": {\r\n            \"self\": \"https://swjshalgoknife.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Ab5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"accountId\": \"712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab\",\r\n            \"emailAddress\": \"jack.watergun@gmail.com\",\r\n            \"avatarUrls\": {\r\n              \"48x48\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-416b-8562-be899b70a92a/48\",\r\n              \"24x24\": \"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:b5e1d6ef-bacc-45b3-8d16-3cd4177bf7ab/0db202a8-0af6-41