[2026-03-22T12:32:49Z] PRE-TOOL-USE: INPUT: {"session_id":"ec2bbc01-bd65-4552-ac2c-998740930f09","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\jackw\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-jackw-Desktop-SwjshAlgoKnife\\ec2bbc01-bd65-4552-ac2c-998740930f09.jsonl","cwd":"C:\\Users\\jackw\\Desktop\\SwjshAlgoKnife","permission_mode":"default","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\jackw\\Desktop\\SwjshAlgoKnife\\data\\brain\\daily-log.md","old_string":"## March 2026\n\n## 2026-03-22 — Parallel Agent Sprint + Jira Status Fix + ECC Benchmark System","new_string":"## March 2026\n\n## 2026-03-22 (Evening) — Cortana Pattern Detection Analysis\n\n### Cortana Report\n**Agent**: Cortana (Research Analyst / Pattern Detective)\n**Workflow**: Primary — Pattern Detection\n\n**Data Analyzed**:\n- 5 backtest datasets (SPY ORB, SPY Supp/Res, ES=F Pivot, BTC-USD BB, GBP/USD VWAP)\n- 288 total trades analyzed\n- Period: Jan 24 - Mar 14, 2026 (50 days)\n\n**Hypotheses Generated** (4 new):\n\n| ID | Hypothesis | Effect Size | Status |\n|----|------------|-------------|--------|\n| H-001 | Morning ORB trades (9:30-11:00) outperform afternoon | +27pp WR | TRACKING |\n| H-002 | Short trades outperform long trades (current regime) | +12pp WR | TRACKING |\n| H-003 | Quick exits (<30 min) beat extended holds | +25pp WR | TRACKING |\n| H-004 | High touch count zones (30+) have better outcomes | +28pp WR | TRACKING |\n\n**Key Findings**:\n1. **Short Bias Edge**: Shorts ~40% WR vs Longs ~28% WR across all strategies\n2. **Duration Risk**: Trades held >1000min show degraded performance (12% WR in ORB)\n3. **Zone Quality**: Supp/Res trades with 30+ touches = ~53% WR vs <10 touches = ~25% WR\n4. **Strategy Ranking** (by Sharpe): SPY ORB (0.62) > Boba (0.06) > BTC BB (-1.39) > Pivot (-2.20)\n\n**Files Created**:\n- `data/brain/pattern-memory.md` — 4 active hypotheses + observations\n\n**Implementation Proposals** (if confirmed):\n- Add touch count filter (min_touches: 20+) to Boba Trades\n- Add time-of-day filter (prefer 9:30-11:00 AM) to ORB\n- Add max hold duration (< 4 hours) to intraday strategies\n\n**Next Analysis Actions**:\n1. Correlate backtest period with SPX/VIX levels\n2. Analyze time-of-day in 30-min buckets\n3. Cross-reference with Arbiter grades when available\n4. Track Sterling FX post-fix (now 8 trades, 75% WR)\n\n**Focus**: Continue tracking all 4 hypotheses until n ≥ 40 per segment\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-22 — Parallel Agent Sprint + Jira Status Fix + ECC Benchmark System","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UZCTEaSY5p9ppxMcBY8skS"}
